# Counter-example: a grapheme whose script does not list it in its repertoire (fires lang:UngroundedGrapheme / shacl.SPARQLConstraintComponent).

@prefix lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:latin a lang:Script .
ex:gX a lang:Grapheme ; lang:inScript ex:latin .
